                <pb facs="0436" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.5048/241: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Carter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-02-19T18:00:00-05:00">February 19, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>21. As Christy cannot complete his arrangements this week, he has had to postpone
                    his sailing until March 7, arriving Monrovia March 20.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
